o/storage/disk50/shows/36a2e445-102c-4d14-9e59-64e1bf1021d7.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk55/shows/96fa457a-198f-4cd4-af50-5fee98bb792e.jpg","likes":46,"dislikes":1,"views":10225,"release_date":"1128643200000","length":7824,"description":"Two sisters, plus a dead mother, a remarried father, and a hostile step-mother. The sisters, each in her way, have perfected the art of losing. The elder, Rose, is an attorney, responsible, lonely, with a closet full of shoes. The younger is Maggie, beautiful, selfish, and irresponsible. Her drunken behavior gets her tossed by her step-mother from her dad's house; worse behavior gets her tossed from Rose's apartment. Then, while searching in her father's desk for money to filch, Maggie finds an address; the past and the future open up to her and, with any luck, may open to her sister as well.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.5}],"value":6.5,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":10298,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}